 "text": "Hello there! How's life treating you? Totally! Lots of calming voice podcasts out there. Would you like something with sound effects, or would you rather read it? Hmm, fair enough. You could always try reading it yourself, in bed with a nightlight. Many classic bedtime stories are just right for this. They' worth trying, though some people don't need them. How long does it take you to fall asleep these days? Then a nightlight and some soothing words might do the trick without any extra effort. How does that sound?",
